title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/repos panel
catalog: Panel
target: repos panel
summary: The repos panel type

!! Commands

* ``repos:init`` — Repos: create a repository in a folder (name optional, default: the folder name)
* ``repos:load`` — Repos: pick a folder and load the repository in it (on-disk, or in-memory: held in memory)
* ``repos:load-known`` — Repos: load a repository the daemon's configuration knows, by its name
* ``repos:open-init`` — Repos: open the init form
* ``repos:open-retype`` — Repos: open the field-type conversion form for the active repository
* ``repos:resume`` — Repos: resume tracking on the active repository
* ``repos:stop`` — Repos: stop one of the active repository's running tasks
* ``repos:toggle-memory`` — Repos: hold a repository in memory, or let go of it (default: the active one)
* ``repos:unload`` — Repos: unload a repository from the daemon
* ``repos:watch-exceeded`` — Repos: list the subtrees left unwatched for want of watch budget

!! Generic commands

Provides ``refresh`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
